   "end": 59.9,
   "text": "Compares with you"
  },
  {
   "start": 60.2,
   "end": 64.2,
   "text": "And these memories lose their meaning"
  },
  {
   "start": 64.8,
   "end": 67.2,
   "text": "When I think of love"
  },
  {
   "start": 67.5,
   "end": 69.3,
   "text": "As something new"
  },
  {
   "start": 69.6,
   "end": 73.8,
   "text": "Though I know I'll never lose affection"
  },
  {
   "start": 74.5,
   "end": 76.4,
   "text": "For people and things"
  },
  {
   "start": 76.8,
   "end": 78.7,
   "text": "That went before"
  },
  {
   "start": 79.1,
   "end": 83.2,
   "text": "I know I'll often stop and think about them"
  },
  {
   "start": 83.8,
